# Zentro App - Quick Reference Rules

## 🪙 Currency: UGX (Ugandan Shillings)

- Use `UGX` prefix, no decimal places
- Format: `UGX {(price || 0).toFixed(0)}`
- Large numbers: `.toLocaleString()`

## 🔌 API Endpoints (Fixed)

- Items: `/api/items/` (NOT `/api/items/item-update/`)
- Categories: `/api/categories/` (NOT `/api/items/item-categories/`)
- Journals: `/api/item-journals/` (NOT `/api/items/item-journal/`)

## 📱 Naming Conventions

- Components: PascalCase (`Items.tsx`)
- Variables: camelCase (`selectedItem`)
- Functions: camelCase (`handleEditItem`)

## 🛡️ Error Handling

- Always check `response && response.results && Array.isArray(response.results)`
- Use optional chaining: `item?.id?.toString()`
- Reset state on errors: `setItems([])`, `setTotalPages(0)`

## 🔄 Loading States

- Main items loading: Shows spinner with "Loading items..." text
- Search loading: Shows small spinner in search bar
- Categories loading: Shows spinner in category picker
- Use `loading`, `searchLoading`, `categoriesLoading` states

## 🏗️ Multi-Tenant

- Base URL: `https://{tenant}.zentroapp-backend.com`
- Fallback: `https://zentroapp-backend.com`

See `.cursor/rules` for complete documentation.
